   "jp": "おびきよせるためだけに{h }お天気を\nわるくするなんて{h }ゆるせない",
   "en": "Making the weather bad just to\nlure us out? Unforgivable!"
  },
  {
   "id": "battle_msg_battle_msg_ep02:0040",
   "idx": [
    1
   ],
   "jp": "太郎ちゃんがぬれて{h }カゼひいたら\nどうしてくれんのよっ",
   "en": "If Taro gets wet and catches a cold,\nwhat are you gonna do about it?!"
  },
  {
   "id": "battle_msg_battle_msg_ep02:0078",
   "idx": [
    2
   ],
   "jp": "そんなりゆうで{h }あめをふらせたのか\nやっぱり{h }おまえたちはゆるせないな",
   "en": "You made it rain for that?\nI really can't forgive you people."
  },
